{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL0VuY2hhbnRlZCUyMCUyODIwMDclMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Enchanted","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/8KCNzCArLlvLdQoHx6npua2VSVc.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u4UpRDi0w84aNrigr9p049rMHiy.jpg","description":"The beautiful princess Giselle is banished by an evil queen from her magical, musical animated land and finds herself in the gritty reality of the streets of modern-day Manhattan. Shocked by this strange new environment that doesn't operate on a \"happily ever after\" basis, Giselle is now adrift in a chaotic world badly in need of enchantment. But when Giselle begins to fall in love with a charmingly flawed divorce lawyer who has come to her aid - even though she is already promised to a perfect fairy tale prince back home - she has to wonder: Can a storybook view of romance survive in the real world?\n\nRated PG · Released 20 Nov 2007 · United States of America · Language: English · 107 min\nStudio: Walt Disney Pictures, Josephson Entertainment, Andalasia Productions\n\nOn your server — Audio: English · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2007","genres":["Comedy","Family","Fantasy","Romance","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.9","imdb_id":"tt0461770","moviedb_id":4523,"tmdbId":4523,"runtime":"107 min","cast":["Amy Adams","Patrick Dempsey","James Marsden","Timothy Spall","Idina Menzel","Rachel Covey","Susan Sarandon","Julie Andrews"],"director":["Kevin Lima"],"writer":["Bill Kelly","Rita Hsiao"],"released":"2007-11-20T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"The real world and the animated world collide.","country":"United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Kevin Lima","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kNqnN6z8S6DcfSTBDQ4G8pYXb3S.jpg"},{"name":"Amy Adams","character":"Giselle","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gn0K6c6d1L6qQrRc86iL8uyIqiF.jpg"},{"name":"Patrick Dempsey","character":"Robe